  "description": "SharpJaad is an AAC decoder and MP4 demultiplexer library written completely in C#. It uses no native libraries, is platform-independent and portable. It can decode AAC-LC (Low Complexity) and HE-AAC (High Efficiency/AAC+). Ported into C# from: sourceforge.net/projects/jaadec",
